Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.16,0:18:53.54,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,使命を果たせ 今こそ 完璧な旋律で
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:58.49,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,どう足掻きもがこうと 無駄なことさ
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:19:01.03,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,Show down! Show down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.17,0:19:03.63,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,轟かせろ!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.79,0:19:06.53,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,Show down! Show down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.68,0:19:09.50,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,勝利を我らの手に Hi!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:08:59.35,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.55,0:19:19.97,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,Show down! Show down! Show down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.60,0:19:25.10,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,さあ、フィナーレの時間だ!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:04.71,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.16,0:18:53.54,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,是时候完成使命了 奏响起完美的旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:58.49,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,任何的挣扎 也都是徒劳
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:19:01.03,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,背水一战！背水一战！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.17,0:19:03.63,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,轰鸣吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.79,0:19:06.53,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,背水一战！背水一战！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.68,0:19:09.50,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,将胜利握于我等之手 嗨!!
